{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"liusima-e-o137","title":"郭援攻河东，贾逵坚守绛邑不拔","accounts":[{"id":"liusima-a-51c45e3f86921eeeabff","label":"正文","text":"郭援攻河东，贾逵坚守绛邑不拔","evidence":["liusima-q-cae6bd33b89086aae2ea"]},{"id":"liusima-a-166d5f07ed54bcaeae6f","label":"正文","text":"郭援召单于并军急攻绛，城将溃，绛父老与援约不害逵","evidence":["liusima-q-377abab9d9a6ba100450"]},{"id":"liusima-a-26d39e0863f29014f392","label":"正文","text":"郭援以兵劫贾逵欲使为将，逵叱不为贼叩头，援怒将斩之","evidence":["liusima-q-e64008b32c6e76d161a8"]},{"id":"liusima-a-1c3213e6938755d51541","label":"正文","text":"绛吏民乘城呼宁俱死，援左右义请，逵得免","evidence":["liusima-q-f362b3b19673ce408b56"]},{"id":"liusima-a-e20bffe08f8a7a2c7cac","label":"裴注·魏略","text":"郭援囚贾逵于壶关土窖，方将杀之","evidence":["liusima-q-ca4f3e20ef829e694a4d"]},{"id":"liusima-a-4ed2aff7d16a2f220f5f","label":"裴注·魏略","text":"祝公道夜盗引贾逵出窖，折械遣去，不语姓名","evidence":["liusima-q-c156a9ae16ecec81a51a"]}],"participants":[{"person":"guanzhang-p0014","role":"攻河东，所经城邑皆下，攻绛不拔；召单于，并军急攻，城将溃；闻逵名欲使为将，以兵劫之，怒将斩之；捕得逵，怒曰促斩之，诸将覆护后乃囚于壶关，闭著土窖中，以车轮盖上，使人固守，方将杀之","evidence":["liusima-q-cae6bd33b89086aae2ea","liusima-q-377abab9d9a6ba100450","liusima-q-e64008b32c6e76d161a8","liusima-q-ca4f3e20ef829e694a4d"]},{"person":"identity-six-20261024-p-jia-kui-liangdao","role":"坚守绛邑；父老约请不害之；不为兵劫所动，叱安有国家长吏为贼叩头；被左右义请，遂得免于死；不肯拜，谓援曰王府君临郡积年，不知足下曷为者也；从窖中谓守者曰此间无健儿邪，而当使义士死此中乎","evidence":["liusima-q-cae6bd33b89086aae2ea","liusima-q-377abab9d9a6ba100450","liusima-q-e64008b32c6e76d161a8","liusima-q-f362b3b19673ce408b56","liusima-q-ca4f3e20ef829e694a4d","liusima-q-c156a9ae16ecec81a51a"]},{"person":"liusima-p0051","role":"与逵非故人，适闻其言，怜其守正危厄，乃夜盗往引出，折械遣去，不语其姓名","evidence":["liusima-q-c156a9ae16ecec81a51a"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["liusima-q-cae6bd33b89086aae2ea","liusima-q-377abab9d9a6ba100450","liusima-q-e64008b32c6e76d161a8","liusima-q-f362b3b19673ce408b56","liusima-q-ca4f3e20ef829e694a4d","liusima-q-c156a9ae16ecec81a51a"]},"ordering_evidence":"liusima-q-cae6bd33b89086aae2ea","source_order":[15,229,13],"order":3342},{"id":"liusima-e-o237","title":"祝公道坐他事当伏法，贾逵救之不能解，为之改服","accounts":[{"id":"liusima-a-1cbb81a2a32b6c70714c","label":"裴注·魏略","text":"祝公道坐他事当伏法，贾逵救之不能解，为之改服","evidence":["liusima-q-108ce8dfd48235530aa7"]}],"participants":[{"person":"identity-six-20261024-p-jia-kui-liangdao","role":"郭援破后乃知前出己者为祝公道；公道坐他事当伏法，救之力不能解，为之改服","evidence":["liusima-q-108ce8dfd48235530aa7"]},{"person":"liusima-p0051","role":"坐他事当伏法","evidence":["liusima-q-108ce8dfd48235530aa7"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["liusima-q-108ce8dfd48235530aa7"]},"ordering_evidence":"liusima-q-108ce8dfd48235530aa7","source_order":[15,245,7],"order":3346}],"persons":[{"id":"liusima-p0051","name":"祝公道","evidence":["liusima-q-c156a9ae16ecec81a51a","liusima-q-108ce8dfd48235530aa7"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"liusima-q-108ce8dfd48235530aa7","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-0541a34e72771fe3b413","layer":"pei","quote":"郭援破后，逵乃知前出己者为祝公道。公道，河南人也。后坐他事，当伏法；逵救之，力不能解，为之改服焉","attribution":"裴注·魏略","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":244,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-4d4ad6b11aaa122dc699","start":7,"end":55},{"id":"liusima-q-377abab9d9a6ba100450","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-19ed90bb5c7ff94e51f3","layer":"original","quote":"乃召单于，并军急攻之，城将溃。绛父老与援要〖3〗，不害逵","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":228,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":38,"end":66},{"id":"liusima-q-c156a9ae16ecec81a51a","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-eb46f175ce294d7925e8","layer":"pei","quote":"逵从窖中谓守者曰：‘此间无健儿邪？而当使义士死此中乎！’时有祝公道者，与逵非故人，而适闻其言；怜其守正危厄，乃夜盗往引出，折械遣去，不语其姓名","attribution":"裴注·魏略","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":242,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-3f3fe78d2db2e117f4ac","start":86,"end":157},{"id":"liusima-q-ca4f3e20ef829e694a4d","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-eb46f175ce294d7925e8","layer":"pei","quote":"援捕得逵。逵不肯拜，谓援曰：‘王府君临郡积年，不知足下曷为者也？’援怒曰：‘促斩之！’诸将覆护，乃囚于壶关；闭著土窖中，以车轮盖上，使人固守，方将杀之","attribution":"裴注·魏略","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":242,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-3f3fe78d2db2e117f4ac","start":10,"end":85},{"id":"liusima-q-cae6bd33b89086aae2ea","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-19ed90bb5c7ff94e51f3","layer":"original","quote":"郭援之攻河东，所经城邑皆下，逵坚守。援攻之，不拔","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":228,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":13,"end":37},{"id":"liusima-q-e64008b32c6e76d161a8","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-19ed90bb5c7ff94e51f3","layer":"original","quote":"绛人既溃，援闻逵名，欲使为将；以兵劫之〖4〗，逵不动。左右引逵，使叩头，逵叱之曰：“安有国家长吏为贼叩头〖5〗！”援怒，将斩之","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":228,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":67,"end":130},{"id":"liusima-q-f362b3b19673ce408b56","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-19ed90bb5c7ff94e51f3","layer":"original","quote":"绛吏民闻将杀逵，皆乘城呼曰：“负要杀我贤君〖6〗，宁俱死耳！”左右义逵，多为请，遂得免","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":228,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":131,"end":174}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
